    <s:String x:Key="Lang.Windows.RestoreGameFiles.Title">Could not detect game version</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Lang.Windows.RestoreGameFiles.NoVersionUpdate">The game version could not be detected. In order to detect new game version you have to activate the VersionsData table update. It is also possible that your game files are corrupted or modified outside the ModAPI.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Lang.Windows.RestoreGameFiles.VersionNotFound">The game version could not be detected. Your game data seems to have been modified outside the ModAPI.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Lang.Windows.RestoreGameFiles.NoSteamText">Because the steam connection is disabled, the ModAPI can't restore your game files for you. Please restore the original state of your game files and let the ModAPI recheck your game. You can also activate the steam connection to let the ModAPI restore your game files.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Lang.Windows.RestoreGameFiles.SteamText">Should the ModAPI restore your files through steam?</s:String>
